# SLEEP (SYSTEM): in 20 minutes it lets everything go. The last three: the loop stops, then the drone
# voices fall away one by one; at the end the clock stops. Not saved: a power-on has no SLEEP.
wait 2000
expect playing 1
expect drone1 1
tap REC
key w2 down
wait 600
key w2 up
wait 1400
tap REC
wait 100
expect looper 2
tap GLO
turn SELECT 9
tap SEL
wait 100
expect sleep 1
tap HOME
shot sleep.png
wait 1000000
expect looper 2
expect drone1 1
wait 30000
expect looper 4
wait 170000
expect drone1 0
expect playing 0
expect sleep 0
reboot
wait 300
expect sleep 0
expect clips 0
